**Inference**

Let's estimate the linear regression model

```{r, include=TRUE}
poly_esg <- lm(MarketCap~Revenue + EnergyConsumption + Industry + Region + poly(GrowthRate, 4) + poly(ESG_Overall, 4), data=esg_data)

summary(poly_esg)
```

